{"4995440":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Draw & Fight","steam_appid":4995440,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw &amp; Fight<\/strong> is a pencil-drawn multiplayer action game in which you draw your own weapon before each battle. The better the drawing, the stronger it comes out. Then it's time to face up to 11 people in a notebook world and be the last one standing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/extras\/3329924c0b074cc5e2de50ae6ea393ed.avif?t=1793701397\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/extras_big\/3329924c0b074cc5e2de50ae6ea393ed.avif?t=1793701397 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have one minute to copy the reference. Was it neat? Strong weapon. Was it crooked? Go to the crooked fight, and everyone will see.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the match the zone closes, fire, ice and explosion powers appear on the map and the dolls fly away with each hammer blow. Play with friends or alone against bots.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/extras\/bb121941cdbf4d6e097a08316420d7f6.avif?t=1793701397\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/extras_big\/bb121941cdbf4d6e097a08316420d7f6.avif?t=1793701397 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main features<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Design your weapon: the quality of the design defines its strength<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Up to 12 players per match<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 3 modes: free-for-all, Teams and Armed Race<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 4 classes and 32 weapons<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Proximity voice chat<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Bots in three difficulties to play alone or complete the room<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Collection of your drawings, challenge of the day and doll customization<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 24  achievements and progress<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• In Portuguese, English, Spanish, Japanese, and Simplified Chinese<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/extras\/f197f7245d8be0f2584abd2a5fd40d9e.avif?t=1793701397\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/extras_big\/f197f7245d8be0f2584abd2a5fd40d9e.avif?t=1793701397 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the pencil. The zone is already closing.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw &amp; Fight<\/strong> is a pencil-drawn multiplayer action game in which you draw your own weapon before each battle. The better the drawing, the stronger it comes out. Then it's time to face up to 11 people in a notebook world and be the last one standing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/extras\/3329924c0b074cc5e2de50ae6ea393ed.avif?t=1793701397\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/extras_big\/3329924c0b074cc5e2de50ae6ea393ed.avif?t=1793701397 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have one minute to copy the reference. Was it neat? Strong weapon. Was it crooked? Go to the crooked fight, and everyone will see.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the match the zone closes, fire, ice and explosion powers appear on the map and the dolls fly away with each hammer blow. Play with friends or alone against bots.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/extras\/bb121941cdbf4d6e097a08316420d7f6.avif?t=1793701397\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/extras_big\/bb121941cdbf4d6e097a08316420d7f6.avif?t=1793701397 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main features<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Design your weapon: the quality of the design defines its strength<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Up to 12 players per match<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 3 modes: free-for-all, Teams and Armed Race<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 4 classes and 32 weapons<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Proximity voice chat<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Bots in three difficulties to play alone or complete the room<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Collection of your drawings, challenge of the day and doll customization<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 24  achievements and progress<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• In Portuguese, English, Spanish, Japanese, and Simplified Chinese<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/extras\/f197f7245d8be0f2584abd2a5fd40d9e.avif?t=1793701397\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/extras_big\/f197f7245d8be0f2584abd2a5fd40d9e.avif?t=1793701397 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the pencil. The zone is already closing.<\/p>","short_description":"A pencil-drawn multiplayer action game in which you draw your own gun. The better the drawing, the harder it hits. Then it's time to fall into a notebook world with up to 12 players, compete for fire and ice powers, and be the last one standing. Crooked sword is also valid.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/bb23d55d864ecd1d39f433830f74ad0ca24b07e1\/header.jpg?t=1793701397","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/46c93d521f8dbf4237396039c738aa8232e9aa0b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793701397","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4995440\/46c93d521f8dbf4237396039c738aa8232e9aa0b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793701397","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 ou superior<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200 (4 threads)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> intel UHD Graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 ou superior<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel Iris Xe Graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Morzz IT"],"publishers":["Morzz IT"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":499,"di